OL,3,GNEWSA'RSC was where Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,4,Afelt at home'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Patrick Stewart felt "most at home"
OL,7,Fat the Royal Shakespeare Company (RSC),
OL,8,Fits former artistic director has said.
OL,10,FTributes have been paid to the renowned
OL,11,FBritish actor, who died at the age of
OL,12,F86 on Wednesday at his home in Los
OL,13,FAngeles, following a "brief and
OL,14,Fpoignant journey" with Alzheimer's
OL,15,Fdisease and Lewy Body Dementia.
OL,17,FSir Patrick began his career on stage
OL,18,Fin Warwickshire, where he honed his
OL,19,Fcraft by performing Shakespeare, before
OL,20,Ffinding international success on screen
OL,21,Fand in Hollywood.
