OL,3,GNEWSA'RSC was where Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,4,Afelt at home'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGregory Doran, the RSC's former
OL,7,Fartistic director, said
OL,8,FStratford-upon-Avon and the theatre
OL,9,Fcompany remained at the heart of the
OL,10,Factor's life, describing it as the
OL,11,Fplace where he "felt most at home".
